{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49931","headline":"酹江月 · 吕岩","name":"酹江月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙风道骨，颠倒运乾坤，平分时节。\n金木相交坎离位，一粒刀圭凝结。\n水虎潜形，火龙伏体，万丈毫光烈。\n仙花朵秀，圣男灵女扳折。\n霄汉此夜中秋，银蟾离海，浪卷千层雪。\n此是天关地轴，谁解推穷圆缺。\n片晌功夫，霎时丹聚，到此凭何诀。\n倚天长啸，洞中无限风月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}